---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Learn more about uconvertfile.com and our mission.",
  no_index: false,
};
---

<Layout title="About Us" seo={seo}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>About uconvertfile.com</h1>
    <p>
      At uconvertfile, our mission is simple: provide the cleanest, most transparent file format
      converter on the web. We noticed a major gap in the market — existing tools are either full
      of ads, too complex, or completely opaque about what actually happens to your files and data.
    </p>
    <h2>Why we built this</h2>
    <p>
      Most users just want to convert a PDF to Word, or compress an image without losing quality.
      They don't want to decipher developer-first API documentation or deal with pop-up ads. We built
      uconvertfile to give you a fast, reliable, and straightforward conversion experience while explaining
      the formats you're working with.
    </p>
    <h2>Privacy First</h2>
    <p>
      We believe in data transparency. Any file you process is kept secure, and our tools run as much as
      possible directly in your browser. We don't hold on to your files longer than necessary.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
